  "content": "伊卡洛斯（Icarus）是一个小型模组，添加了多种色彩独特、可穿戴在背部（Curios栏位）或披风（Trinkets栏位）的翅膀。\n\n翅膀仅有两个缺点：飞行时会消耗饥饿值，且穿戴护甲时会降低最大速度。你穿戴的护甲越多，速度降低幅度越大，最高可降至正常最大速度的2/3（可配置）。此外，还有可通过数据包将翅膀添加至一个标签的功能，使它们飞行时不消耗饥饿值。\n\n# 查看由 [Zeddy](https://www.youtube.com/@zeddyminecraft) 制作的精彩展示视频：\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/yTYI6g2g07E\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n# 全新耐力系统！\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/kyCy4u1pbSw\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n---\n\n### 合成配方：\n![合成配方](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/723db6c848c7302197286a87aa3f3b12f178ac52.png)\n\n---\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n    <tr>\n        <th><b>加入我的Discord服务器</b></th>\n        <th><b>支持我的Ko-Fi！</b></th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <th><a href=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/discord\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/discord.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Discord服务器\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Discord服务器\"></a></th>\n        <th><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/camellias/tiers\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/kofi.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\"></a></th>\n    </tr>\n</table>",
